:''For other uses, see [[Saki (disambiguation)]].''
'''Saki Nijima''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] who was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and is obtained via the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. Her [[True Form]] was added in the same update and grants immunity to slow and increases attack and health.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 393
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Saki Nijima
|name2 = Saki Nijima CC
|name3 = Samba Saki CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Saki Nijima CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Samba Saki CC''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
While she is not too good alone against a horde of Dark enemies, she proves her worth on the [[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages|XP Stages]]. She is designed to be shielded more often than not and, when she is properly shielded, she can slow down enemies like the [[Teacher Bun Bun|Bun Bun]] family and most Dark enemies. Unfortunately, against Floating enemies, she can be replaced by a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]], who is more spammable than her.

{{Job|Classification=Crowd-Controller}}

